正在调用模型，直接生成 SQL……
SELECT Student.Major, Student.Age
FROM Student
WHERE NOT EXISTS (
    SELECT 1
    FROM Has_Pet
    JOIN Pets ON Has_Pet.PetID = Pets.PetID
    WHERE Has_Pet.StuID = Student.StuID
      AND LOWER(Pets.PetType) = 'cat'
);
与 Gold 结果是否匹配： True
